                ],
                [
                    103.0,
                    925.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "2. Assess",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                935,
                170,
                957
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 12,
            "group_id": 13,
            "global_block_id": 13,
            "global_group_id": 13,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    79.0,
                    935.0
                ],
                [
                    169.0,
                    935.0
                ],
                [
                    169.0,
                    956.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    956.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Do the underlined words in each sentence contain familiar information that connects the sentence to the preceding ones? If you answer no, your sentences are probably not cohesive, and you should revise.",
            "block_bbox": [
                102,
                967,
                771,
                1043
            ],
            "block_id": 14,
            "block_order": 13,
            "group_id": 14,
            "global_block_id": 14,
            "global_group_id": 14,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    102.0,
                    967.0
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    967.0
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    1043.0
                ],
                [
                    102.0,
                    1043.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. Do the underlined words constitute a relatively small set of related ideas? Even if you see how they are related, will your readers? If you answer no, the passage may not seem coherent, and you should revise.",
            "block_bbox": [
                104,
                1051,
                772,
                1128
            ],
            "block_id": 15,
            "block_order": 14,
            "group_id": 15,
            "global_block_id": 15,
            "global_group_id": 15,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    104.0,
                    1051.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    1051.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    1128.0
                ],
                [
                    104.0,
                    1128.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. Do the underlined words name the most important characters, real or abstract? Again, if you answer no, you should revise.",
            "block_bbox": [
                105,
                1135,
                770,
                1184
            ],
            "block_id": 16,
            "block_order": 15,
            "group_id": 16,
            "global_block_id": 16,
            "global_group_id": 16,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    105.0,
                    1135.0
                ],
                [
                    770.0,
                    1135.0
                ],
                [
                    770.0,
                    1184.0
                ],
                [
                    105.0,
                    1184.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. Imagine giving the passage a title. The words in it are likely to name important topics and should appear in the words you underlined.",
